  "script_text": "project \"Trim Effect\" { width 1280 height 720 fps 30 duration 6 background #1e1e26 }\n\nscene s1 { name \"Cena 1\" opacity 1.0 }\n\nshape estrela {\n  scene s1\n  type star\n  pos 320 360\n  size 220 220\n  color #ffd166\n  trim_start 0.0\n  trim_end 0.5\n}\n\nshape triangulo {\n  scene s1\n  type triangle\n  pos 640 360\n  size 200 200\n  color #ef476f\n  trim_start 0.25\n  trim_end 0.75\n}\n\nshape retangulo {\n  scene s1\n  type rect\n  pos 960 360\n  size 200 200\n  color #06d6a0\n  trim_start 0.5\n  trim_end 1.0\n}\n\npen circulo_trim {\n  scene s1\n  pos 320 600\n  stroke 3\n  fill on\n  color #118ab2\n  trim_start 0.0\n  trim_end 0.3\n  codigo {\n    circle 0 0 60\n  }\n}\n\npen espiral_trim {\n  scene s1\n  pos 640 600\n  stroke 2\n  color #f78c6b\n  trim_start 0.6\n  trim_end 1.0\n  codigo {\n    repeat 100 {\n      let a = i * 0.15\n      let r = i * 2.2\n      line (cos(a)*r) (sin(a)*r)\n    }\n  }\n}\n\ntext texto_trim {\n  scene s1\n  content \"TRIM\"\n  size 72\n  bold on\n  color #7affa3\n  pos 960 600\n  trim_start 0.0\n  trim_end 0.6\n}\n\nedge s1.out -> master.in\n",
